Not bundled, and downloaded by the rendered page in the reader's browser:
the webR worker and R WebAssembly binaries (GPL-3, from webr.r-wasm.org),
the Pyodide runtime (from cdn.jsdelivr.net), Plotly (from cdn.plot.ly, only
when a Python cell produces a Plotly figure), and any R or Python packages a
tutorial uses. No GPL-licensed code is included in this package.
